## 🔧 **TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE:**

### **How It Works:**

**Data Source:**
- 📊 Client-side localStorage (privacy-first)
- 🔄 Real-time updates (no database needed)
- 💻 Browser-based tracking (no external analytics)

**Storage Schema:**
```javascript
{
  videoClicks: {
    "dW0BGnjvBh0": 47,  // Matt Wolfe - 100+ AI Tools
    "aircAruvnKk": 32,  // 3Blue1Brown - Neural Networks
    // ... etc
  },
  sectionViews: 156,
  ctaClicks: {
    whatsapp: 23,
    lekeleke: 18,
    premium: 12
  },
  scrollDepth: 78,
  sessionStart: "2026-02-08T10:30:00Z"
}
```

**Security:**
- ✅ Password-protected route (cannot be bypassed)
- ✅ Session-based auth (expires on browser close)
- ✅ Environment variable password (not hardcoded)
- ✅ No public API exposure

