## 💡 BEST RECOMMENDATION (OPTION A - KEEP BOTH)

**Use them TOGETHER strategically:**

1. **Keep GPT-4 bot** for:
   - After-hours (midnight-9am when you're sleeping)
   - FAQ questions
   - Initial qualification
   - Tire-kickers

2. **Use Tawk.to** for:
   - Business hours (9am-6pm when you're available)
   - Serious buyers (you see they viewed pricing page + case studies)
   - Enterprise deals
   - When visitor is from Lagos/Abuja (local clients)
   - When someone spends 10+ minutes on site

**How this works:**
- Visitor lands on site → Sees Tawk.to widget (gold bubble)
- Clicks chat → Tawk.to shows you notification on mobile
- If you're busy → GPT-4 bot takes over automatically
- If you're available → YOU respond personally

**Why this is BEST:**
- AI handles volume (100+ chats/day)
- YOU handle value (5-10 high-ticket leads/day)
- Mobile app alerts you to VIP visitors
- You close $50K deals personally while AI handles "How much?" questions

